sequenceDiagram
    actor Learner
    participant PWA as PWA Client (Browser)
    participant LocalEngine as AdaptiveEngine (client copy)
    participant SW as Service Worker
    participant API as Express /api/profile/complete-module
    participant ServerEngine as AdaptiveEngine (server copy, same module)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Learner->>PWA: Submit module assessment score
    PWA->>LocalEngine: evaluateModuleCompletion(profile, moduleId, score)
    LocalEngine-->>PWA: decision - ADVANCE or REMEDIATE (instant, offline)
    PWA-->>Learner: Immediate feedback and next module from cached path
    PWA->>SW: POST /api/profile/complete-module (queued if offline)
    SW->>API: Forward request once connectivity is available
    API->>ServerEngine: evaluateModuleCompletion(profile, moduleId, score)
    ServerEngine-->>API: authoritative decision
    API->>DB: profile.save()
    API-->>PWA: confirmed decision and updated profile
    PWA->>PWA: reconcile localStorage with server response
